# Kapitel 17 – Zugriffsrechte
# Datei: /etc/mosquitto/acl

# Leap-Gateway (Python auf dem Raspberry Pi): darf nur unter leap/ schreiben
user leap
topic readwrite leap/#

# openHAB (MQTT-Broker-Thing): liest Sensordaten, darf Steuer-Topics schreiben
user openhab
topic read leap/#
topic write leap/+/cmd/#
topic readwrite robot/#

# ROS-2-Brücke (Kapitel 26)
user robot
topic readwrite robot/#
topic read leap/#
